        <mxCell id="lifecycle-v17" value="&lt;b&gt;This demo (Zava, 2026-11-01):&lt;/b&gt; ✅ Provision · ✅ Build &amp;amp; publish (azd) · ✅ Frontier (25 seats) · ✅ Consent · ✅ Hire: MiraRetail, TheoCorporate (admin center), BankingBids, PublicSectorBids (Entra API) · ✅ RFP Bid Desk verified end to end (per-instance Search access) · ▶ Operate (docs/07, docs/12)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
