        <mxCell id="analogy-v13" value="&lt;b&gt;📹 Cameras&lt;/b&gt; record the badge number and the office that printed it&lt;br&gt;= token claims azp/appid (agent identity) · xms_par_app_azp (blueprint) · oid&lt;br&gt;→ /whoami, sign-in logs, Application Insights" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="analogy-1">
