        <mxCell id="analogy-v25" value="&lt;b&gt;Three tokens in badge terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;T1&lt;/b&gt; – the office proves itself to the printer (blueprint, federated credential); never sent to a resource&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Badge swipe&lt;/b&gt; – agent identity token, app-only: idtyp=app, xms_sub_fct=11 → Azure AI Search&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Employee login&lt;/b&gt; – agent user token: idtyp=user, xms_sub_fct=13 → Microsoft 365 tools (Mail, Teams, Word, SharePoint)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Where to put a new permission&lt;/b&gt;: every instance needs it → blueprint · differs per team → that agent identity (Azure) or agent user (Microsoft 365) · business data → never the container identity" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="analogy-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="1540" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
